      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BOIOBOI (1) met with strong support to start at $2.05 on debut last start over 1000m at Dubbo but after leading for home he folded badly from inside the 150m. Respect that heavy backing last time and give him another chance back to 900m. MIA AMORE (9) travelled near the speed then held on well for a close fourth on debut last time out over 1000m at Muswellbrook. Draws in a lot closer today and with that race experience on board she looks a serious threat. FRATIANNO (2) ended a long sequence of minor placings with a close fourth recently over 1200m at Port Macquarie. Has lined up 22 times for 11 placings so he must go in the exotics combinations. LITTLE BUBBLES (5) had been going okay before last start when caught on a limb at Muswellbrook. Goes from gate 11 to gate one which brings her right into calculations. BLAZING COURAGE (7) resumes. Wasn't beaten far at her only run over today's distance back in April. Should give a good account.",
